From: HardDinD developers
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] um: sort a window-local page pool for coalesced host mappings

Default off: uml_fault_sorted=1. Requires ascending prefault visitation.
Ordinary order-0 allocation, clearing and memcg
charging remain. A task/VMA/range-owned pool exists only within the window;
unused pages are freed on all nonfatal exits. No reclaim or emergency reserves.
The transient pool contains at most 512 pages before normal per-page charge.

